		(uuid 727abb5b-7667-5982-897d-07d2f9c504cb))
	(text "One pyro channel. J124.2 RAW -> external F1 5A FAST -> J124.1 BUS1. Black J124 ARM / J121 IGN; identify by silk and pin legends."
		(at 20.32 330 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid bad85868-df48-5625-9786-5945a78f27c2))
	(text "With the ARM plug out NOTHING connects RAW_ACT to PYRO1_BUS. No test point on BUS, IGN or OUT."
		(at 20.32 337.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 20f879dc-af7e-5240-9108-073154f04d2c))
	(text "Igniter across J121.1 OUT and J121.2 IGN. J124 and J121 pin numbering (the net on each pin) is retained from the reviewed CH1. R9: both on M3_DB128L_2P_BK_SW (the DB128L with pads 1 and 2 swapped: same part C430601, same land), turned so both wires enter from -x (pyro leads west) with pin 2 (RAW / IGN) forward and pin 1 (BUS / OUT) aft."
		(at 20.32 345.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 8ed85766-b8f6-5093-8118-1fa3f48dbd2a))
	(text "Gate: MCU -> 220R -> gate; 1k pull-down on MCU side; 10k + 220nF gate-source (P0-1/P0-2). Off in reset/unpowered."
		(at 20.32 352.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 2c5c599a-2813-5ee4-9d27-f9b056fe43ca))
	(text "PE3 (pin 2) and PE6 (pin 5) are sentinels with no net: firmware drives them low. Never enable TRACE on PE2-PE6."
		(at 20.32 360.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 23b571db-5945-56d5-ae80-b3030e357aad))
	(text "CONT: R173 + R129 over R130 || R178 from drain. ARM: R132 + R175 over R133 || R180 from fused bus."
		(at 20.32 368.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 3e1e8e8a-3b08-5551-a4fd-878c6260a1f4))
	(text "D120 cathode 1 + R131 10k: cold pull-up for plug-out FET-short detection. Cathode 2 NC. In flight: log only, never veto."
		(at 20.32 375.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 8de6969f-e2ce-515d-881e-a9dec42e2b6b))
